T1  - Psychometric properties of the Tinnitus Functional Index (TFI): Assessment in a UK research volunteer population
AU  - Fackrell, Kathryn
AU  - Hall, Deborah A.
AU  - Barry, Johanna G.
AU  - Hoare, Derek J.
JO  - Hearing Research
VL  - 335
SP  - 220
EP  - 235
PY  - 2016
DA  - 2016/05/01/
