T1  - Clinical pharmacokinetics of kavalactones after oral dosing of standardized kava extract in healthy volunteers
AU  - Kanumuri, Siva Rama Raju
AU  - Mamallapalli, Jessica
AU  - Nelson, Robyn
AU  - McCurdy, Christopher R.
AU  - Mathews, Carol A.
AU  - Xing, Chengguo
